> 5 out of 5 hunks failed -- saving rejects to file src/uhitm.c.rej

Did you have some other patches before you got that message? If they
changed the same parts of the sources, it's possible that the patches
conflict and you have to do the changes manually. But usually at least
some chunk gets handled in these cases..

It's also possible that the line breaks in the patches are in the format
that confuses the patch utility you're using. Unix-like systems use 
just linefeeds, while ms-dos -like systems use CR before the LF, and if
your patch utility can't handle the difference you need to convert them.

